VNumber -- a package for computing the v-number and v-function
**************************************************************

Description
===========

VNumber is a package for computing the v-number of homogeneous ideals and
v-function of monomial ideals



Authors
=======

  * Antonino Ficarra (see https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Antonino-Ficarra
    ) <antficarra@unime.it>
  * Emanuele Sgroi (see https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Emanuele-Sgroi )
    <emasgroi@unime.it>

