vNumber -- compute the $\text{v}$-number of homogeneous ideal $I$
*****************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        vNumberP(I,p)
  * Inputs:
      * I, an *note ideal: (Macaulay2Doc)Ideal,, a homogeneous ideal of
        polynomial ring $S = \mathbb{K}[x_1,\ldots,x_n]$, $\mathbb{K}$ a field
  * Outputs:
      * k, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 

Description
===========

This method computes the $\text{v}$-number of $I$:
$$\text{v}(I)=\min\{\text{deg}(f):f\in S\ \text{is homogeneous, and}\
(I:f)\in\text{Ass}(I)\}.$$

+----------------------------------------+
|i1 : S = QQ[x_1..x_3];                  |
+----------------------------------------+
|i2 : I = ideal(x_1*x_2,x_1*x_3,x_2*x_3);|
|                                        |
|o2 : Ideal of S                         |
+----------------------------------------+
|i3 : vNumber(I)                         |
|                                        |
|o3 = 1                                  |
+----------------------------------------+
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : S = QQ[x_1..x_4];                            |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : I = ideal(x_1^3*x_2+x_3^4,x_1+x_2+x_4,x_3^3);|
|                                                  |
|o5 : Ideal of S                                   |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : vNumber(I)                                   |
|                                                  |
|o6 = 5                                            |
+--------------------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note vNumberP: vNumberP, -- compute the $\text{v}_\mathfrak{p}$-number of
    homogeneous ideal $I$
  * *note vFunctionP: vFunctionP, -- compute the
    $\text{v}_\mathfrak{p}$-function of monomial ideal $I$
  * *note vFunction: vFunction, -- compute the $\text{v}$-function of monomial
    ideal $I$

Ways to use vNumber:
====================

  * "vNumber(Ideal)"

For the programmer
==================

The object *note vNumber: vNumber, is a *note method function:
(Macaulay2Doc)MethodFunction,.

